  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845856,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the shoes of the legendary James Bond in *007 - Der Morgen Stirbt Nie* for PlayStation! Based on the thrilling 1997 film, you'll embark on a globe-trotting mission to thwart Elliot Carver's nefarious plot to ignite a war between Britain and China. Carver, a ruthless media mogul, sinks a British ship to manipulate global events and seize control.\n\nExperience a third-person action adventure that expands upon the film's storyline, featuring new locations and gameplay elements not seen in the movie. Engage in intense firefights, utilize Bond’s signature gadgets like laser cufflinks, and navigate thrilling sequences including skiing and driving sections. While initially intended to continue the film’s narrative, the game incorporates familiar scenes and moments that fans will recognize.\n\nDeveloped by Black Ops Entertainment, *007 - Der Morgen Stirbt Nie* offers a unique Bond experience on PlayStation, though it aims to distinguish itself from the groundbreaking *GoldenEye*. Featuring a memorable soundtrack by Tommy Tallarico, prepare for a single-player adventure filled with espionage, action, and the iconic charm of 007."
    },
